<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek June inflation down 3.1 pct from May.</title>
<headline>Uzbek June inflation down 3.1 pct from May.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's June consumer prices fell 3.1 percent from May's 2.9-percent rise, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>UZBEKISTAN CONSUMER PRICES  June '97  May '97  June '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change     -3.1	+2.9	+0.07</p>
<p>Inflation in 1996 was 60 percent. The government and the central bank have targeted this year's inflation at 24 percent annual.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
